							"text": "Database: yieldgrid (Character set: utf8mb4_unicode_ci)\nRelational Tables & Schema Structures:\n• users (user_id PK, name, username UNIQUE, password, role, contact, is_active)\n• crops (crop_id PK, farmer_id FK, crop_name, quantity, price, available)\n• orders (order_id PK, customer_id FK, order_date, total_amount, status)\n• order_items (item_id PK, order_id FK, crop_id FK, quantity, unit_price, subtotal)"
